      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELECTROJET (7) had the drop on the pace early but forged to the lead on the bend and drew clear to score (23.72) at Traralgon in a Grade 4/5 over 425m. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. BLACKPOOL FINN (4) has found the frame here at the last couple of runs when prominent throughout, most recently when second beaten 1.75 lengths (21.96). Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Overdue and expected to feature again. RHYTHMIC ENERGY (1) was in the money last time at Healesville (19.26) in a Special conditions Veteran race, finishing a half a length third. Has already won seven times from this draw.",
